1
00:00:00,800 --> 00:00:04,144
Four relatives want to help. Who has the whole plan?

2
00:00:06,200 --> 00:00:11,039
CareRelay gives a fictional family one shared coordination
workspace.

3
00:00:11,300 --> 00:00:16,451
Start with the original messages. The reference date keeps
local times in

4
00:00:16,451 --> 00:00:16,880
context.

5
00:00:17,400 --> 00:00:23,055
Ministral Three, fourteen billion parameters, reads the
source locally through Ollama. The

6
00:00:23,055 --> 00:00:26,354
input is synthetic. The inference is real.

7
00:00:27,000 --> 00:00:32,468
Each suggestion includes its source quote. A reviewer
checks the task, date,

8
00:00:32,468 --> 00:00:37,937
proposed caregiver, and uncertainty before approving. The
plan only contains items a

9
00:00:37,937 --> 00:00:39,304
person has reviewed.

10
00:00:40,800 --> 00:00:45,344
Maya has a work conflict. The return ride has no driver.
Both

11
00:00:45,344 --> 00:00:46,101
stay visible.

12
00:00:47,100 --> 00:00:51,001
Robin accepts her pickup. Only she can give that consent.

13
00:00:51,800 --> 00:00:57,067
Now the appointment moves. The reviewer selects the
original item and confirms

14
00:00:57,067 --> 00:01:02,334
the new time. CareRelay cancels the old record and keeps
the replacement.

15
00:01:02,334 --> 00:01:04,529
Transport remains a separate decision.

16
00:01:07,200 --> 00:01:12,030
The calendar shows the replacement date, with the original
history preserved.

17
00:01:12,500 --> 00:01:16,978
Accepted commitments and open questions stay separate,
with evidence.

18
00:01:17,800 --> 00:01:21,569
Approve before sharing. Nothing is sent automatically.

19
00:01:22,500 --> 00:01:26,245
This demonstration ends with five active approved tasks,
one accepted responsibility, and

20
00:01:26,245 --> 00:01:29,989
two source imports. A model suggestion to cancel transport
was rejected because

21
00:01:29,989 --> 00:01:33,734
its quote did not support that change. Exact evidence
still needs human

22
00:01:33,734 --> 00:01:37,478
judgment. This is a local prototype for fictional data,
not medical advice

23
00:01:37,478 --> 00:01:41,223
or a production household service. The payoff is less
reconstructing the chat,

24
00:01:41,223 --> 00:01:44,968
and a clearer place to start the next conversation.
CareRelay. A little

25
00:01:44,968 --> 00:01:45,904
less to carry.
